{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0149-s001", "text": "Gymnasieutbildning för vuxna ger färdigheter för fortsatta studier vid universitet och yrkeshögskolor och inom yrkesutbildning som baserar sig på gymnasiets lärokurs.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053920194351+0000-3/hb-c08-u0149-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.001632653061224, "peak": 0.284271240234375, "generation_seconds": 51.36587883415632, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0149-s002", "text": "Studierna vid ett vuxengymnasium ordnas som dags- eller kvällsundervisning och kan avläggas vid sidan av arbetet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053920194351+0000-3/hb-c08-u0149-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.280242919921875, "generation_seconds": 37.00876165507361, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0149-s003", "text": "Studierna kan bestå av närundervisning eller nätundervisning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053920194351+0000-3/hb-c08-u0149-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.2769775390625, "generation_seconds": 20.715299325995147, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0150-s001", "text": "Vid ett vuxengymnasium kan man avlägga gymnasiets hela lärokurs och studentexamen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053920194351+0000-3/hb-c08-u0150-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.383945578231293, "peak": 0.259918212890625, "generation_seconds": 24.844788463786244, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0150-s002", "text": "Man kan också studera lärokursen för ett eller flera gymnasieämnen eller enskilda studieperioder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053920194351+0000-3/hb-c08-u0150-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.264862060546875, "generation_seconds": 26.57814274611883, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0150-s003", "text": "Att avlägga enskilda studieperioder vid ett vuxengymnasium är avgiftsbelagt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053920194351+0000-3/hb-c08-u0150-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.37469482421875, "generation_seconds": 25.05090150097385, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0151-s001", "text": "Vid vuxengymnasier följs grunderna för läroplanen för gymnasieutbildning för vuxna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053920194351+0000-3/hb-c08-u0151-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.36151123046875, "generation_seconds": 25.4477275358513, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0151-s002", "text": "Att avlägga en hel gymnasieutbildning tar 2–4 år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053920194351+0000-3/hb-c08-u0151-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.399444580078125, "generation_seconds": 17.1713089318946, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
